exports[`e-mails > 3-alert-every-type reads as before 1`] = `
{
  "preheader": "14 new alerts from the 22:04 measurement.",
  "subject": "The 10:00 measurement failed, and 13 more alerts",
  "text": "MEASURED ON FRI 30 OCT AT 22:04

14 new alerts

* The 10:00 measurement failed
  The retry at 11:12 also failed. Error: http_503.
* The 10:00 measurement was skipped
  The database version (2) doesn't match the code (3).
* oralcare.se showed no slots for 42% of clinics and treatments
  Muntra had slots for them. The values are saved as "Could not be measured".
* Only 88% of clinics and treatments were measured
  143 of 162. The rest are saved as "Could not be measured".
* The 08:00 measurement stopped early
  The daily request budget was used up.
* The 08:00 measurement stopped early
  5 requests in a row failed.
* Akut undersökning is not online at Example Clinic Norr
  81 slots in Muntra that patients can't book on oralcare.se.
* Konsultation aligner was removed from oralcare.se
  It is no longer in the booking menu.
* 12 slots not online at Example Clinic Söder
  Tandhygienistbehandling: slots in Muntra that patients can't book on oralcare.se, in two measurements in a row.
* oralcare.se now takes bookings 60 days ahead
  It was 90 days.
* Muntra shows early slots that oralcare.se doesn't
  4 clinics have slots in Muntra in the next 2 hours that oralcare.se doesn't show.
* Muntra changed its data format
  Field data.0.relationships.caregiver: expected object, got undefined, in 3 responses.
* oralcare.se rejected a request from the collector
  Tandblekning at Example Clinic Väst.
* oralcare.se showed a slot before the window
  Basundersökning at Example Clinic Öst.

Open Oral Care Digital: https://digital.oralcaregroup.com

--

Oral Care Group – Digital · digital@oralcaregroup.com

You get this e-mail because you are an admin in Oral Care Digital.",
}
`;

